WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.025 --> 00:00:04.393
Click Game Management to assign gates.

2
00:00:04.410 --> 00:00:10.173
Choose the restrictor gate shape first.

3
00:00:10.182 --> 00:00:17.272
Review the assigned games list.

4
